\newlabel{fig:fig3}{{3}{7}{Sensitivity analysis illustrating False Positive Rates and Negative Result Detection Rates across varying quantitative refutation thresholds (tau from 0.00 to 0.20 and delta bounds from 0.01 to 0.10). FPG planning maintains robust performance stability across threshold variations.\relax }{figure.caption.4}{}}
