\newlabel{fig:fig4}{{4}{8}{Trajectory Rationalization Index (TRI) measuring recursive rationalization and hallucinated success justifications in agent reasoning traces across machine learning domains (Classification, Regression, Time Series). FPG planning suppresses rationalization to 0.096 compared to 0.807 for procedural agents.\relax }{figure.caption.5}{}}
